pan class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/DSimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.Result\">Result</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"No change. If `done = true`, skip remaining simplification steps for this term. ","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/DSimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.Result.rfl","kind":"ctor","line":45,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.Result.rfl","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/DSimpM.lean#L45-L46"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">inductive</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/DSimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.Result\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">DSimp</span>.<span class=\"name\">Result</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./foundational_types.html\">Type</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"The result of definitionally simplifying an expression `e`.\n\nThe `done` flag controls whether simplification should continue after this result:\n- `done = false` (default): Continue with subsequent simplification steps. If a\n  `pre`/`post` method returns `.step e' false`, `dsimp` recurses on `e'`.\n- `done = true`: Stop processing, return this result as final.\n\nUnlike `Sym.Simp.Result`, this carries no proof term and no `contextDependent` flag.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/DSimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.Result","kind":"inductive","line":34,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.Result","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/DSimpM.lean#L34-L49"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">instance</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/DSimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.instInhabitedConfig\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">DSimp</span>.<span class=\"name\">instInhabitedConfig</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Inhabited\">Inhabited</a> <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/DSimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.Config\">Config</a></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/DSimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.instInhabitedConfig","kind":"instance","line":32,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.instInhabitedConfig","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/DSimpM.lean#L32-L32"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/DSimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.Config.instances\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">DSimp</span>.<span class=\"name\">Config</span>.<span class=\"name\">instances</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/DSimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.Config\">Config</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"If `instances` is `true`, `dsimp` will visit instance arguments.\nThis is set to `false` by default as simplifying in instances is usually not meaningful and we\nwant to avoid producing non-standard instances. However, in certain situations simplifying in\ninstances can aid with making more terms syntactically equal.\n","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/DSimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.Config.instances","kind":"def","line":31,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.Config.instances","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/DSimpM.lean#L31-L31"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">abbrev</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/DSimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.Config.maxSteps\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">DSimp</span>.<span class=\"name\">Config</span>.<span class=\"name\">maxSteps</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\">\n<span class=\"fn\">(<span class=\"fn\">self</span> : <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/DSimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.Config\">Config</a>)</span></span>\n<span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a></div></div>","info":{"doc":"Maximum number of steps that can be performed by the simplifier. ","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/DSimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.Config.maxSteps","kind":"def","line":24,"name":"Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.Config.maxSteps","sourceLink":"https://github.com/leanprover/lean4/blob/6a10ac8c22beadecabdbb0919c2b50214762f91d/src/Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/DSimpM.lean#L24-L24"}},{"header":"<div class=\"decl_header\"><span class=\"decl_kind\">constructor</span>\n<span class=\"decl_name\"><a class=\"break_within\" href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/DSimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.Config.mk\"><span class=\"name\">Lean</span>.<span class=\"name\">Meta</span>.<span class=\"name\">Sym</span>.<span class=\"name\">DSimp</span>.<span class=\"name\">Config</span>.<span class=\"name\">mk</span></a></span><span class=\"decl_args\"> :</span><div class=\"decl_type\"><span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Nat\">Nat</a> → <span class=\"fn\"><a href=\"./Init/Prelude.html#Bool\">Bool</a> → <a href=\"./Lean/Meta/Sym/DSimp/DSimpM.html#Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.Config\">Lean.Meta.Sym.DSimp.Config</a></span></span></div></div>","info":{"doc":"","docLink":"./Lean/Meta/Sym/DSi